      "saves_and_settings": "portcove-managed",
      "manual_preparation": "Provide your own single-track CHDs for SLUS-01156 and SLUS-01179 in disc order and retail SCPH-1001 BIOS. Portcove verifies each disc’s data track and builds a private player with its registered toolchain, retaining its declared saves, settings and installed mods. Choose the disc when you choose Play. To change discs, use the game’s own disc change if it offers one, or quit and choose Play with the next disc. Upstream confirmed one change to Disc 2 on an earlier build; this version’s disc changes haven’t been tested. Bundled mods belong to the runtime version. Windows and Linux package and source fit were statically inspected. Native build, disc switching, gameplay and save compatibility remain unobserved."
